  "traps": ["Corrected 2026-11-10: the App Group group.Gunndamental.OpenIntelligence is on both App IDs and in both entitlements files, and LibraryWidget is in OpenIntelligenceLiveActivitiesBundle (it was held until then, 2026-10-15). The widgets read the app's accent from the group's defaults (LiveActivityTint.shared).", "Search setup (5.8) reuses QueryLiveActivityAttributes with ContentState.isSetup = true: the widget hides Stop and shows a search symbol for it. QueryLiveActivityService.endLeftovers ends it with any other non-running activity of that type, which is intended (it ends when the app is in front anyway), and an answer's Live Activity replaces it."],
